# Gossip: what she knows about other people. {deed} the fact in her words, {who}/{who2} the people, {src} who told
# her, {how} witness/heard/rumor, {exposure} secret/rumored/known, {whobond} how close she is to {who}.

@rule me.gossip
on me.gossip
- [Heard anything interesting lately?|So, what's the latest?|Any news going around?]
- [Tell me something I don't know.|What's everyone talking about?]
- [Any juicy stories from class?|What's new with everyone?|Anything happen while I wasn't looking?]

@rule me.gossip.close
on me.gossip
when rel=girlfriend|lover|friend
- [Okay, spill.|Come on, I know you know something.]
- [You've got that look. What happened?|Don't hold out on me.|Tell me. I won't say a word.]
- [I can tell you're dying to say something.|Come on, who did what?]

# ---------------- the facts ----------------
@rule gossip.plain
on gossip
hook f_gossip_plain
opens ask,agree,tease
- [Did you hear? {Deed}.|Guess what. {Deed}.|So apparently {deed}.] [{When}, too.|Can you believe it?|Nobody saw that coming.]
- [You won't believe it: {deed}.|Big news. {Deed}.] [{When}.|The whole class knows already.|I'm still processing it.]
- [Okay, listen. {Deed}.|Hey, did you know? {Deed}.] [Crazy, right?|I only found out {when}.]

@rule gossip.couple
on gossip
when realverb=started_dating|engaged
feel smile
hook f_gossip_couple
opens ask,agree,tease
- [{Who} and {who2} are going out now!|Did you hear? {Who} and {who2}!] [I knew it!|They're so cute together.|I give it a month.]
- [So, {who} and {who2}...|You won't believe who's dating.] [It's official.|{Who} told me herself.]
- [Guess who's holding hands in the hallway now? {Who} and {who2}.|{Who} said yes to {who2}!] [So sweet.|About time.]

@rule gossip.breakup
on gossip
when realverb=broke_up
feel worried
hook f_gossip_breakup
opens ask,defend,agree
- [{Who} and {who2} broke up.|It's over between {who} and {who2}.] [{Who} cried all through lunch.|I feel bad for them.|I saw it coming, honestly.]
- [{Who} and {who2} split up {when}.|Did you hear? {Who} dumped {who2}.] [Brutal.|Nobody's sure who ended it.]
- [So... {who} is single again.|Bad news about {who} and {who2}.] [Be nice to her for a while.|They didn't even last a month.]

@rule gossip.fight
on gossip
when realverb=fought|insulted
feel worried
hook f_gossip_fight
opens ask,defend,agree
- {student}[{Who} and {who2} had a huge fight {when}.|Things are tense between {who} and {who2}.] [Nobody knows why.|Everyone in class went quiet.|I'm staying out of it.]
- {student}[Did you see {who} glaring at {who2}?|{Who} and {who2} aren't speaking.] [Something happened {when}.|The air in class is so heavy.]
- [{Who} yelled at {who2} {when}.|I've never seen {who} so mad.] [Over something stupid, probably.|{Who2} looked like she wanted to cry.]

@rule gossip.madeup
on gossip
when realverb=made_up
feel smile
hook f_gossip_madeup
opens agree,ask,tease
- [{Who} and {who2} made up!|Good news: {who} and {who2} are talking again.] [Finally.|It was getting awkward for everyone.]
- [{Who} and {who2} were laughing together {when}.|The war between {who} and {who2} is over.] [Like nothing happened.|Peace at last.]
- [{Who} apologized to {who2}.|They hugged it out, {who} and {who2}.] [I was so relieved.|Cute, right?]

@rule gossip.crush
on gossip
when realverb=crush
feel smile
hook f_gossip_crush
opens ask,tease,hush
- [Don't tell anyone, but... {deed}.|Promise you won't say anything? {Deed}.] [It's so obvious.|She turns red every time.|I'm sworn to secrecy, so you didn't hear it from me.]
- [Between us... {deed}.|I wasn't supposed to notice, but {deed}.] [Isn't that adorable?|Keep it secret, okay?]
- [You'll never guess. {Deed}.|Okay, swear on your life. {Deed}.] [Act surprised if she tells you.|She'd die if she knew I said.]

@rule gossip.together
on gossip
when realverb=seen_together
hook f_gossip_together
opens ask,laugh,defend
- [{Who} and {who2} were seen behind the gym.|Someone saw {who} and {who2} sneaking off together.] [What do you think they were doing?|Scandalous, right?]
- [{Who} and {who2} left campus together {when}.|I keep seeing {who} and {who2} side by side.] [Coincidence? I don't think so.|Something's going on.]
- [{Who} and {who2} were sharing a bento.|Have you noticed {who} and {who2} lately?] [Very suspicious.|Always together.]

@rule gossip.drama
on gossip
when realverb=left_for|cheated
feel worried
hook f_gossip_drama
opens ask,defend,agree
- [Have you heard the drama? {Deed}.|It's all anyone talks about: {deed}.] [It's a total mess.|I don't know whose side to take.]
- [Okay, so the latest disaster: {deed}.|Everyone's whispering. {Deed}.] [I can't believe it.|Someone's going to get hurt.]
- [You've heard, right? {Deed}.|The hallway's on fire. {Deed}.] [What a mess.|I feel bad for everyone involved.]

@rule gossip.boysroom
on gossip
when realverb=seen_boys_room
feel smile
hook f_gossip_boysroom
opens laugh,defend,hush
- [So {who} got caught in the boys' restroom {when}.|Okay, this is embarrassing for her, but... {deed}.] [{laugh}|She says she got lost.|I'd never live it down.]
- [Did you hear about {who} and the boys' restroom?|Poor {who}. {Deed}.] [She swears it was an accident.|She's been hiding all day.]
- [{Who} walked into the wrong restroom {when}.|The boys are still talking about {who}.] [Red as a tomato.|It's legendary now.]

# ---------------- how she knows ----------------
@rule gossip.heard
on gossip
when how=heard
hook f_gossip_heard
opens ask,agree,defend
- [{Src} told me {deed}.|According to {src}, {deed}.|I heard from {src} that {deed}.] [Don't say I told you.|{Src} never gets these things wrong.]
- [{Src} mentioned that {deed}.|Word from {src}: {deed}.] [She seemed sure.|Interesting, right?]
- [{Src} swore me to secrecy, but {deed}.|Okay, {src} let it slip: {deed}.] [So now you know too.|Act surprised if it comes up.]

@rule gossip.rumor
on gossip
when how=rumor
hook f_gossip_rumor
opens ask,defend,laugh
- [People are saying {deed}.|There's a rumor that {deed}.] [I don't know if it's true.|You know how people talk.|Take it with a grain of salt.]
- [Rumor has it {deed}.|Somebody said {deed}.] [Could be nonsense.|I'm just repeating what I heard.]
- [The whole class thinks {deed}.|There's talk that {deed}.] [I'm not sure I believe it.|Who knows, really.]

@rule gossip.saw
on gossip
when how=witness
hook f_gossip_saw
opens ask,agree,tease
- [I saw it myself: {deed}.|I was right there when {deed}.] [{When}.|Seriously, with my own eyes.]
- [Swear on my life, {deed}.|I watched it happen: {deed}.] [I couldn't look away.|Nobody believes me.]
- [Right in front of me, {deed}.|I was there. {Deed}.] [I'm still shocked.|{When}, no less.]

# ---------------- about a friend of hers ----------------
@rule gossip.friend.worried
on gossip
when whobond>=50 valence<=-1
feel sad
hook f_gossip_friend_worried
opens comfort,defend,ask
- [I'm worried about {who}.|{Who}'s my friend, so...] [{Deed}.|She's taking it hard.|I don't know how to help her.]
- [{Who} won't talk about it.|It's about {who}.] [{Deed}.|I wish I could do more.]
- [Have you seen {who} today?|{Who} hasn't been herself.] [{Deed}.|I'm scared she's hiding how bad it is.]

@rule gossip.friend.happy
on gossip
when whobond>=50 valence>=1
feel smile
hook f_gossip_friend_happy
opens agree,praise,ask
- [I'm so happy for {who}!|{Who} finally did it!] [{Deed}.|She deserves it.]
- [Big news for {who}!|You have to congratulate {who}.] [{Deed}.|I almost cried.]
- [{Who} is so happy right now.|I'm proud of {who}.] [{Deed}.|She's been glowing all day.]

# ---------------- voices ----------------
@rule gossip.cool
on gossip
when voice=cool|serious|proper
hook f_gossip_cool
opens ask,agree
- [I don't usually spread rumors, but {deed}.|For what it's worth, {deed}.] [Do what you want with that.|I thought you should know.]
- [I'll say it once: {deed}.|Fact, not rumor: {deed}.] [Don't repeat it.|That's all.]
- [I happened to hear that {deed}.|You'll find out anyway, so: {deed}.] [I don't judge.|No need to make a fuss.]

@rule gossip.gyaru
on gossip
when voice=gyaru|open|vamp
feel smile
hook f_gossip_gyaru
opens ask,tease,laugh
- [Okay okay okay, so get this: {deed}.|You did NOT hear this from me, but {deed}.] [Like, wow.|I'm dying.|Isn't that wild?]
- [Babe, you won't believe this: {deed}.|Hot news: {deed}.] [Like, literally!|Spread it. Or don't.]
- [Oh my god, okay, so {deed}.|Listen listen: {deed}.] [I'm screaming.|The group chat exploded.]
